    ("Stroke Symptoms (FAST Test)", "A stroke cuts off blood to the brain and requires immediate intervention. Remember FAST: F (Face) - Ask them to smile; does one side droop? A (Arms) - Ask them to raise both arms; does one drift downward? S (Speech) - Ask them to repeat a simple phrase; is their speech slurred? T (Time) - If you observe any of these, call an ambulance immediately. Time is brain cells.", "Medical Emergency"),
